        "G00009"
      ],
      "document_id": "DOC001",
      "content": "Investing the same $1 today yields dollars tomorrow. If the pound depreciates relative to the dollar, a gain in the UK bond can be erased when converting back to dollars. UK bond returns 10% minus 5% capital loss due to dollar appreciation yields a net 5% return. Both US and UK bond strategies give the same net 5% return in equilibrium.",
      "section": null,
      "page_range": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "extraction_metadata": {
        "source_grounding": {
          "validation_scope": "exact quotation, chunk membership and field coverage only",
          "mechanically_valid": true,
          "semantic_entailment_verified": false,
          "evidence": [
            {
              "source_id": "G00008",
              "quote": "I invest the same today, $1, and I get dollars tomorrow.",
              "fields": [
                "/fact_text"
              ],
              "match_count": 1,
              "start_char": 39,
              "end_char": 95,
              "offset_basis": "supplied_source_unit_text; zero-based; end exclusive"
            },
            {
              "source_id": "G00008",
              "quote": "But then when I convert it back to dollar,\n I may lose all that gain because the pound has depreciated\n vis-a-vis the dollar.",
              "fields": [
                "/fact_text"
              ],
              "match_count": 1,
              "start_char": 553,
              "end_char": 678,
              "offset_basis": "supplied_source_unit_text; zero-based; end exclusive"
            },
            {
              "source_id": "G00009",
              "quote": "If I go the UK bond route, I get 10% in return in the bond, minus 5% in the capital loss\n due to the appreciation of the dollar.",
              "fields": [
                "/fact_text"
              ],
              "match_count": 1,
              "start_char": 106,
              "end_char": 234,
              "offset_basis": "supplied_source_unit_text; zero-based; end exclusive"
            },
